Page.fetch

Run window.fetch in this Page, obey browser CORS, and return a structured response. Options: timeout: Maximum duration in milliseconds. saveAs: Write the response body to this absolute path without text conversion. method: HTTP method. headers: Request headers. body: Request body. cache (default | no-store | reload | no-cache | force-cache | only-if-cached): Fetch cache mode. credentials (omit | same-origin | include): Fetch credentials mode. integrity: Subresource integrity value. keepalive: Allow the request to outlive the page. mode (cors | no-cors | same-origin): Fetch request mode. redirect (follow | error | manual): Redirect handling mode. referrer: Request referrer. referrerPolicy: Request referrer policy.

await page.fetch(url, options?)

